**`src/inventory.py`** (4 bugs):
- `__init__`: mutable default `{}` shared state across instances → switched to `None` default with `dict(initial)` copy
- `add`: overwrote stock instead of accumulating → changed to `self._stock.get(sku, 0) + qty`
- `reserve`: `>=` blocked reserving exact available quantity → changed to `>`
